  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PK Pakistan Earthquake ERC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objectives are to support the efforts of the Government of Pakistan to:  (i) Reduce the immediate suffering resulting from the effects of the earthquake and restore livelihoods destroyed by the earthquake; (ii) Restore basic services to the affected population and rebuild public infrastructure; and (iii) Start the recovery and reconstruction process.</narrative>
  </description>
